# Raw/unprocessed camera & drone exports — large source dumps kept locally
# only, several of which exceed GitHub's 100MB per-file limit outright.
# The actual site assets are the renamed copies in the same folders (see
# public/images/README.md for the mapping); these originals aren't
# referenced by any code, so excluding them doesn't affect the site.
public/images/**/*.MP4
public/images/**/*.mp4
public/images/**/*.mov
public/images/tours/kayak[0-9].webp
public/images/tours/nighttour[0-9].webp
public/images/surf-lessons/surf[0-9].webp
public/images/surf-lessons/surf[0-9].webp.jpg
